# Redirects for cloudbridge.jetsquirrel.cloud, applied by Cloudflare's static
# assets. The site used to be a few hand-written pages on GitHub Pages; their
# addresses are linked from the app, the README, release notes and other
# people's posts, so each goes to where its content lives now.

/docs.html /docs/ 301
/docs.html/ /docs/ 301
/policies.html /docs/permissions 301
/policies.md /docs/permissions 301

# The blog is a section of its own at /blog/ (blog/ in this repository). It
