# /docs/blog/; both older forms land on the post's address here.
/blog.html /blog/ 301
/blog/cloudbridge-0-5-0.html /blog/cloudbridge-0-5-0 301
/blog/cloudbridge-0-5-0.md /blog/cloudbridge-0-5-0 301
